  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Finance for Community Resilience: Climate Finance for Pacific CSOs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tagged funding to UN Development Programme&#x2019;s Governance for Resilient Development in the Pacific Phase 2 (Gov4Res2) Small Grant Initiative, supporting Pacific CSOs to deliver improved food and water security in five &#xa0;Pacific countries.
Deliver grants to CSOs, build national architecture that increases access to climate finance for CSOs, and supporting capacity and capability building of CSOs.</narrative>
  </description>
